  "body": "Here reside the MSCs which could qualify for vNext if they had an appropriate implementation.\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2244 - Mass redactions\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2176 - Redaction rule updates (has implementation)\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2174 - Move `redacts` to elsewhere in the event definition\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2175 - Drop `creator` from create events\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/pull/2828 - Restrict allowed user IDs over federation\r\n* https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-doc/issues/1229 - Mitigating abuse of the `depth` parameter",
